    "title": "7 Minute Workout",
    "description": "If you want to lose weight, have a flat belly and a perfect body, use our 7 Minute Workout, which will help you tone your abs, with video explanations for each move.\r\n\r\n7 Minute Workout will be the suitable software for ordinary people to exercise! You can exercise anytime, anywhere, it only takes 7 minutes! You can use it to exercise your major muscles and keep fit safely, effectively and efficiently. Try the 7 Minute Workout App to make you healthier!\r\n\r\nWhy choose 7 Minute Workout?\r\n\r\n\u00b7 Exercise anytime, anywhere, no equipment required\r\n\r\n\u00b7 Daily exercise challenges help you develop good exercise habits\r\n\r\n\u00b7 Compete with friends to gain more encouragement and support\r\n\r\n\u00b7 Earn achievements as you level up from novice to athlete level\r\n\r\n\u00b7 Personal workouts tailored to individual needs and preferences\r\n\r\n\u00b7 3D character demonstration makes it easier to master the essentials of actions\r\n\r\nYou only need to spend 7 minutes every day, and then you can regulate your body and strengthen your body.",
